  "bodyHash": "036faf3ff61efa36",
  "content": "\n\n<p>本 Create 插件添加了传动链！这是一个实用的方块，可用于在传送带之间传递旋转动力。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354280/description_e8fd8f30-3abc-40f5-99ec-cc3884095006.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354280/description_073bf77b-1aa3-4fa9-af01-48c696c6f994.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>它可以用于连接直角传送带、连续传送带，甚至上下重叠的传送带！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354280/description_206dec95-bb0f-4902-9a1c-8c04cde6ea5d.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>它的设计旨在简化传送带的动力传输，避免使用齿轮箱和封闭式链传动带来的繁琐布局，同时也不会让这些旧方案过时！实际上，传动链只能放置在传送带上……但如果你希望不受限制地放置它们，配置文件中提供了一个选项可以实现该功能！</p>\n<p>以下是一些改进示例：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_053a5d14-0bd6-423e-b8fc-e3c432a95728.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3cbaa15c-ea47-47aa-b758-cb92db420d87.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8db55b6b-a83f-4e1d-a426-d35e11b7700e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67faabc5-d517-48e4-ab15-ff9f010b834d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ccc25b24-e4ba-4940-b53f-6ee19fa6566f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>它也可以像传送带一样被封闭！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_971272f1-3035-4e10-a15e-9c7fd0fe1805.png\"><br>希望你喜欢我的模组！玩得开心！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1e8c87e3-831e-4187-9374-59ac8179c0c6.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
